The ideal of the parameter space of all homogeneous ideals with this lead term
ideal is an ideal in 24 variables.  Often, these parameter ideals are in too
many variables to easily analyze them.  But in this case we can determine the
irreducible components of the ideal $J$.  There are two components, of
dimensions 8 and 11.  Note that they are both rational varieties.

