Minimalize -- boolean option of groebnerStratum (currently a no-op)
*******************************************************************

Description
===========

This is an optional input for the *note groebnerStratum: groebnerStratum,
function.  It is intended to control whether eliminable parameters are
eliminated to obtain the Groebner stratum in a smaller ring.

At present this option is not yet implemented: passing Minimalize => true
prints a warning and otherwise behaves exactly like Minimalize => false.  See
the source-level minimalizeFamily draft in GroebnerStrata.m2 for the current
blocker (the parameter ring built by *note groebnerFamily: groebnerFamily, has
a single GRevLex block, but the parameter-elimination logic needs a Lex
subblock to identify eliminable parameters).

See also
========

  * *note groebnerStratum: groebnerStratum, -- compute the ideal where a given
    is a Groebner basis

